WEBVTT - Havilah Product Overview (30 seconds)

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Wellbeing data is scattered and hard to trust.

00:04.000 --> 00:07.000
Employees check in privately. Responses stay anonymous.

00:07.000 --> 00:10.000
Validated clinical tools: PHQ-9, GAD-7, PSS-10, FAS-10, and COPSOQ-III.

00:10.000 --> 00:13.500
When support is needed, a medical assessor is one step away.

00:13.500 --> 00:17.000
Secure text chat with anonymous case codes and complete privacy.

00:17.000 --> 00:19.000
HR sees patterns, never individuals. Individual answers stay hidden below 5 responses.

00:19.000 --> 00:25.000
Once 5 or more colleagues respond, aggregated group trends appear.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
Havilah. Workplace wellbeing, measured with care.
